0 FILE game_boy.ldr
0 Game Boy
0 Name: game_boy.ldr
0 Author: brickkit

0 // Everything in the grey body goes on upside down. Start with the curved brick, round end down, and press the 1 x 2 tile onto its stud from below. Two 1 x 1 plates go on the tile's free end
1 71 0 0 0 0 0 -1 0 -1 0 -1 0 0 6091.dat
1 71 -10 0 0 -1 0 0 0 -1 0 0 0 1 3069b.dat
1 71 -20 -8 0 -1 0 0 0 -1 0 0 0 1 3024.dat
1 71 -20 -16 0 -1 0 0 0 -1 0 0 0 1 3024.dat
0 STEP
0 // Two bricks with a stud on the side, studs to the front: one on the ledge, one on the curved brick. A 1 x 1 plate tops the lower one
1 71 0 -16 0 -1 0 0 0 -1 0 0 0 1 87087.dat
1 71 20 -32 0 -1 0 0 0 -1 0 0 0 1 87087.dat
1 71 0 -40 0 -1 0 0 0 -1 0 0 0 1 3024.dat
0 STEP
0 // Press the D-pad onto the two plates, its second brick hanging behind, and lock it in with the 1 x 2 plate across the top
1 16 -20 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 dpad.ldr
1 71 -10 -48 0 -1 0 0 0 -1 0 0 0 1 3023b.dat
0 STEP
0 // The screen's frame. Lay the two brackets with the upright end on their side studs, so their plates stand along the back with studs to the front: the 1 x 1 over the D-pad, the 1 x 2 beside it
1 72 -20 -70 2 1 0 0 0 0 -1 0 1 0 36840.dat
1 72 10 -70 2 1 0 0 0 0 -1 0 1 0 99780.dat
0 STEP
0 // Press the other two brackets onto those studs, plates to the front and side studs up: the 1 x 2 on the left this time, so the joins do not line up
1 72 -10 -70 -6 -1 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 99781.dat
1 72 20 -70 -6 -1 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 36841.dat
0 STEP
0 // Two 1 x 3 plates on the studs on top, then the top edge: a 1 x 1 plate on the left and a 1 x 2 tile
1 72 0 -92 4 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3623.dat
1 72 0 -100 4 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3623.dat
1 71 -20 -108 4 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3024.dat
1 71 10 -108 4 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3069b.dat
0 STEP
0 // The screen: three clear 1 x 2 tiles standing side by side, each on one of the studs facing forward
1 47 -20 -80 -14 0 0 -1 -1 0 0 0 1 0 3069b.dat
1 47 0 -80 -14 0 0 -1 -1 0 0 0 1 0 3069b.dat
1 47 20 -80 -14 0 0 -1 -1 0 0 0 1 0 3069b.dat
0 STEP
0 // The A and B buttons: a round tile on each stud on the front
1 26 0 -26 -18 1 0 0 0 0 -1 0 1 0 98138.dat
1 26 20 -42 -18 1 0 0 0 0 -1 0 1 0 98138.dat
0 STEP
0 NOFILE

0 FILE dpad.ldr
